<title>USA: Diagnon in H. pylori pact with NIH unit.</title>
<headline>Diagnon in H. pylori pact with NIH unit.</headline>
<dateline>ROCKVILLE, Md. 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diagnon Corp said Tuesday that it has signed a two year agreement with the National Institute of Diabetes and Digestive and Kidney Diseases of the National Institutes of Health (NIH) to foster the development of new antibiotics and protective vaccines for the treatment and prevention of Helicobacter pylori (H.pylori) infection.</p>
<p>H.pylori is a bacterium that is associated with most duodenal and gastric ulcers.</p>
